    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/5068b8c389f3bb857f98f90db30df247.poster.avif?t=1695369908\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/5068b8c389f3bb857f98f90db30df247.webm?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/5068b8c389f3bb857f98f90db30df247.mp4?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CUT GRASS. BUY UPGRADES. MOW GNOMES </h2><br>Legend of the Landscaper is a satisfying survival roguelike. You are a landscaper thrown into a hedge maze on a job for a bizarre mansion homeowner, equipped with nothing but a sword and a watering can. Mow down enemies as you mow down grass, gathering boons from the flowers you help along the way. Gather as much coin as you can before the maze inevitably tosses you out so that you may buy upgrades to help in your next attempt<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/6687b9d082cc6b2643c8dd6129dc20ae.poster.avif?t=1695369908\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/6687b9d082cc6b2643c8dd6129dc20ae.webm?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/6687b9d082cc6b2643c8dd6129dc20ae.mp4?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/5068b8c389f3bb857f98f90db30df247.poster.avif?t=1695369908\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/5068b8c389f3bb857f98f90db30df247.webm?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/5068b8c389f3bb857f98f90db30df247.mp4?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > CUT GRASS. BUY UPGRADES. MOW GNOMES </h2><br>Legend of the Landscaper is a satisfying survival roguelike. You are a landscaper thrown into a hedge maze on a job for a bizarre mansion homeowner, equipped with nothing but a sword and a watering can. Mow down enemies as you mow down grass, gathering boons from the flowers you help along the way. Gather as much coin as you can before the maze inevitably tosses you out so that you may buy upgrades to help in your next attempt<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/6687b9d082cc6b2643c8dd6129dc20ae.poster.avif?t=1695369908\" width=536 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/6687b9d082cc6b2643c8dd6129dc20ae.webm?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2582890/extras/6687b9d082cc6b2643c8dd6129dc20ae.mp4?t=1695369908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
